<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 150 million SFR five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 150 million SFR five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch has launched the following bond.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.0 PCT   MATURITY    08.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.35    PAY DATE    08.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
